WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:00.750
Tonight, we're getting

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.502
more details about the explosion

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.504
at a crucial bridge linking the U.S.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.422
and Canada.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:06.965
The FBI saying tonight

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:09.300
that there is no connection to terrorism

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.094
in that fiery car crash

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:12.929
and that no explosive materials

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:14.597
were found at the scene.

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:17.600
Instead, we're learning that a 2022

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.977
Bentley two door

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.729
coupe entered from the U.S.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.522
side and quickly accelerated

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.150
before hitting a curb and going airborne.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:25.692
Now, Governor

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.985
Hochul says a resident

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.361
from western New York

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.238
was involved in that crash.

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:31.489
But in the hours before,

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:32.532
we had a clear picture

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.616
of what was going on here,

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:35.493
it didn't stop one network

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:39.789
from linking it to possible terror.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.791
What I've been told is that this was

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.918
an attempted terrorist attack.

00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:45.754
They believe the two people in that car

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:46.796
who are now both dead

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:47.213
after that

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.173
large explosion

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.716
there have

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.677
packed that car full of explosives.

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.637
As for what types of explosives?

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:56.097
We're not sure just yet.

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.766
We don't know how long

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:58.224
the people

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:58.933
who perpetrated

00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:01.686
this attack have been in this country.

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:03.480
Did they come into the country legally?

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:04.355
Did they come across

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:06.107
illegally and claim asylum

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:06.483
where they

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:09.486
some of the nearly 1 million got aways

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:10.987
who've come into this country?

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:11.654
Remember that

00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:13.615
most of these terrorist organizations,

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.200
they're Gen Z, right. They're wrong.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.284
If you look at the

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:17.535
if you look at what Hamas

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:19.329
puts out online, online

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:21.456
on Tik Tok, they're very sophisticated.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:22.082
It could be that

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.500
these people were just inspired.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.626
It's pretty easy to figure out

00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:28.630
how to do this online. Unfortunately.

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:30.090
And joining me now for more

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:33.802
on this is CNN's Oliver Darcy Oliver.

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:34.219
Wow.

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:34.427
I mean,

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.261
what can you tell us about

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:36.179
how long they were

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:38.098
reporting this as a terror attack

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:39.390
so confidently

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:42.435
and how many people this bad information

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.520
could have reached?

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:43.937
Yeah, I mean,

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.772
this was irresponsible reporting.

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.107
This was reckless reporting.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.024
And by all accounts,

00:01:48.024 --> 00:01:50.110
it was inaccurate reporting.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.486
We now know that the governor

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:52.987
saying there was no indication

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:54.072
that there was a terrorist attack.

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:55.990
But that's not what Fox News

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:56.991
initially reported

00:01:56.991 --> 00:01:58.243
and reported for hours.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:01:59.327
I want to give you a sense of

00:01:59.327 --> 00:02:01.454
of how they reported this early on

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.247
in the afternoon.

00:02:02.247 --> 00:02:03.248
They sent a push alert

00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:04.374
to all their

00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:05.291
mobile phones, people

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.251
with mobile app installed

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:08.002
and it said that the New York vehicle

00:02:08.002 --> 00:02:09.671
explosion is attempt a terror attack

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:11.131
according to sources of theirs.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.424
They plastered this on the front page

00:02:13.424 --> 00:02:14.801
of their highly trafficked website.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:15.343
And, of course,

00:02:15.343 --> 00:02:16.970
Fox is a very highly rated channel.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.596
So millions of people

00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:20.140
probably saw this information

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.307
just from Fox News alone.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:21.766
And of course,

00:02:21.766 --> 00:02:23.518
then there's the word of mouth factor.

00:02:23.518 --> 00:02:25.979
So a lot of people were misinformed

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.522
by this inaccurate report.

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:28.356
And that's

00:02:28.356 --> 00:02:29.607
why Fox News

00:02:29.607 --> 00:02:30.608
really owes

00:02:30.608 --> 00:02:32.318
their audience and everyone else

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.194
a correction.

00:02:33.194 --> 00:02:34.279
But they still have

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:35.989
not actually issued a correction.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:36.698
You know,

00:02:36.698 --> 00:02:39.701
they quietly edited out the huge mistakes

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.619
on their digital online pieces.

00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:42.829
The correspondent

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.497
who inaccurately reported this,

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.040
she went on air

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.167
and walked back

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.668
the reporting while basically

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:49.669
blaming her sources

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:50.587
for bad information,

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:52.422
taking no responsibility

00:02:52.422 --> 00:02:53.965
of her own for this.

00:02:53.965 --> 00:02:56.134
And that's really what separates Abby,

00:02:56.134 --> 00:02:58.803
I think, a real credible news

00:02:58.803 --> 00:03:01.055
organization, one that you can trust

00:03:01.055 --> 00:03:04.267
from a outlet that really doesn't

00:03:04.267 --> 00:03:05.727
have much credibility these days

00:03:05.727 --> 00:03:07.478
and reporting facts.

00:03:07.478 --> 00:03:08.688
When you make a mistake,

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:10.231
you're transparent, the audience.

00:03:10.231 --> 00:03:11.566
Fox is not doing that.

00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:12.817
They made a bad mistake

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:14.777
and they're really hiding,

00:03:14.777 --> 00:03:15.570
hiding from it.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:18.072
And it penetrated even to,

00:03:18.072 --> 00:03:19.574
you know, political figures, people

00:03:19.574 --> 00:03:20.533
like Vivek Ramaswamy,

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:21.659
who actually saw him in one of those

00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:23.953
clips, and Kerry Lake out in Arizona.

00:03:23.953 --> 00:03:25.246
They amplified the claim

00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:26.789
that this could be terror on

00:03:26.789 --> 00:03:29.250
social media.

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:30.668
That was wrong, too.

00:03:30.668 --> 00:03:32.629
And it had real impacts.

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:33.671
That was definitely wrong.

00:03:33.671 --> 00:03:34.756
And, you know, if you look at Vivek's

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:37.717
page, you know, all those tweets about

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.468
the border

00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:40.303
and possible terror attack,

00:03:40.303 --> 00:03:42.472
those are still live on his on his page.

00:03:42.472 --> 00:03:43.681
And he's a guy who purports

00:03:43.681 --> 00:03:45.183
to apparently care about the truth.

00:03:45.183 --> 00:03:47.560
Why hasn't he corrected this to his

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.353
to his audience?

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:49.938
You know, and Fox News

00:03:49.938 --> 00:03:50.480
itself,

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.899
they were talking about Islamic terrorism

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:53.524
on the air.

00:03:53.524 --> 00:03:56.319
I mean, this was not a small mistake.

00:03:56.319 --> 00:03:57.820
This was a huge mistake.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:58.571
If it was happening

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.281
at a serious news organization, if,

00:04:00.281 --> 00:04:01.658
say, The New York Times or CNN

00:04:01.658 --> 00:04:02.951
had made a mistake like this,

00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:04.327
there would be a huge autopsy.

00:04:04.327 --> 00:04:05.411
People would be suspended,

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.038
maybe lose their jobs over this.

00:04:07.038 --> 00:04:08.706
But, you know, in the right wing

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:10.333
information space,

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:12.210
there really is little accountability

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:13.419
for getting stories wrong.

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:15.296
Even if you get them this wrong.

00:04:15.296 --> 00:04:16.172
Yeah, I mean, it

00:04:16.172 --> 00:04:17.382
fit a particular narrative.

00:04:17.382 --> 00:04:19.133
It just turned out that narrative

00:04:19.133 --> 00:04:20.260
wasn't true.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.010
Oliver Darcy,

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:23.179
thank you so much for coming in for us.

